# web — environment variables (OPTIONAL — normally NOTHING to set here).
# The frontend calls the API on a same-origin relative path (/api), proxied to
# the api service by nginx (in the built image) or the Vite dev server (locally).
# So no API URL needs to be set or baked in.
#
# Format (Vite):
#   - only vars prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the client bundle
#   - plain KEY=value, one per line
#
# No secrets here — this ships to the browser. Never put a secret in a VITE_ var.

# --- API ---

# VITE_API_BASE=   # optional: override to hit a separate API host; leave UNSET for same-origin /api